# PS-to-VNC Raspberry Pi X11 panel candidate provenance.
#
# This file records the package-managed authority from which the tracked
# pre-Issue40 lxpanel-pi profile was copied. The profile itself is carried
# byte-for-byte rather than recreated from memory.

